This directory is part of the Data Processing Suite. For further information 
look at:

http://www.cs.purdue.edu/homes/sb/Projects/DPS

Compiling:

Use the Makefile in this directory. On SGI use

make sgi

on DEC-ALPHA use

make alpha

on PC running LINUX use

make linux

Please report any problems, bug or inconveniences to

steller@hawaii.bio.purdue.edu

	
